      "content": "TL 00 NE             REDBOURN             CHERRYTREE LANE                                           (east side) 8/138                                     Large barn at Wood End                                           Farm, 30 metres SSW of                                           farmhouse GV                                        II Barn.  Late C18 or early C19.  Timber frame.  Weatherboarding. Red brick plinth.  4 bays.  Double purlin roof, the upper purlins with collar.  Straight wind and tie braces.  Roof is plain tile on W, corrugated asbestos on E;   gabled cart entrance 2nd bay from N. Listing NGR: TL0860909687"
    }
